  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU Response to Health and Socio-Economic Impact of COVID-19 in the IGAD Region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This multiagency response aims to support the Intergovernmental Authority on Development (IGAD) to respond to the COVID-19 pandemic.  Working with partners IOMs component of the project focusses on supporting selected IGAD Member States increase access to health for vulnerable groups with a specific focus on sites identified by IGAD that have quarantine/isolation or screening facilities.</narrative>
  </description>
